<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>https://isolodaonenonly.wordpress.com</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #f7f7f7;
      color: #333;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header {
      background: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.5em;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.2em;
    }
    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    footer {
      background: #222;
      color: #ccc;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    a {
      color: #4CAF50;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>https://isolodaonenonly.wordpress.com 🚀</h1>
    <p>This is my free website powered by GitHub Pages & wordpress</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hello! I built this website for free using <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> and a free domain from <strong>Freenom</strong>. Pretty cool, right?</p>
    
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>🌐 Project 1 – My first web app</li>
      <li>📱 Project 2 – Mobile app idea</li>
      <li>🎨 Project 3 – Creative design</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>You can reach me at: <a href="mailto:youremail@example.com">isolobenjamin@outlook.com</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>Made with ❤️ using GitHub Pages</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
